	(property "Description" "Micro-Fit 3.0 vertical through-hole. Exact Molex header and matching 43025 housing. Motor contacts use 18 AWG; signal contacts use 24 AWG. Apply manufacturer populated-circuit/temperature derating; not the single-contact maximum. One six-wire cable carries motor M1/M2 and four encoder wires. Retain the motor-supplied connector and verify its cavity map. Neither motor pin is encoder GND."
